{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    
    The code must be placed in ONE Shopify section file.
    with view all products button and with link , i want in the image as cart icon button and view all products button with links 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:{{ block.settings.background }};padding:40px 20px;color:#14231a}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:1240px;margin:auto}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:22px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font:400 clamp(28px,4vw,42px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;color:#1f5130;margin:0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all{display:inline-flex;padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid #1f5130;border-radius:99px;color:#1f5130;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all:hover{background:#1f5130;color:#fff}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;padding:5px 4px 18px;scrollbar-width:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{position:relative;flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);overflow:hidden;border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(20,45,27,.08);scroll-snap-align:start;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(20,45,27,.14)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{height:clamp(200px,23vw,290px);position:relative;background:#f1efe7;overflow:hidden}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .3s}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{transform:scale(1.035)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:12px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:99px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__best{left:12px;background:#1f5130;color:#fff}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale{right:12px;background:#ffd60a;color:#14231a}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;width:48px;height:48px;border:0;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.2);transition:transform .2s,background .2s;z-index:2}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:hover{background:#0d3a1d;transform:scale(1.07)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:focus-visible,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd60a;outline-offset:3px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{padding:14px 16px 17px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{font-size:12px;color:#315c3a;background:#f1f5e9;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 8px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:400 21px/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:#1f5130;margin:10px 0 4px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{font-size:13px;color:#5b6660;margin:0 0 12px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{font-size:12px;color:#68736c;text-decoration:line-through;margin-left:6px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:2px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #cdd8cd;background:#fff;color:#1f5130;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next{background:#1f5130;color:#fff;border-color:#1f5130}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:900px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:30px 14px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:84%}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{height:250px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{scroll-behavior:auto}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><h2 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% if block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}<a class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div>
<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track aria-label="Plant products">
{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign ik='image_' | append:i
assign tk='title_' | append:i
assign dk='description_' | append:i
assign pk='price_' | append:i
assign ck='compare_' | append:i
assign sk='discount_' | append:i
assign bk='bestseller_' | append:i
assign rk='rating_' | append:i
assign nk='reviews_' | append:i
assign lk='link_' | append:i
assign product_key='product_' | append:i
assign image=block.settings[ik]
assign title=block.settings[tk]
assign description=block.settings[dk]
assign price=block.settings[pk]
assign compare=block.settings[ck]
assign discount=block.settings[sk]
assign bestseller=block.settings[bk]
assign rating=block.settings[rk]
assign reviews=block.settings[nk]
assign link=block.settings[lk]
assign product=block.settings[product_key]
if product != blank
assign title=product.title
endif
%}{% if title != blank or image != blank or product != blank %}<article class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">{% if image != blank %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default:title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">{% elsif product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default:title | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}{% if bestseller %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__best">{{ block.settings.bestseller_label | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% if discount != blank %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale">{{ discount | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
{% if product != blank %}<form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" type="submit" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart" {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 13H4L5 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button></form>{% elsif link != blank %}<a class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" href="{{ link }}" aria-label="View {{ title | escape }}"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 13H4L5 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></a>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body"><span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ rating | escape }} | {{ reviews | escape }}</span><h3 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ title | escape }}</h3>{% if description != blank %}<p class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{% if product != blank %}{{ product.price | money }}{% else %}{{ price | escape }}{% endif %}{% if product != blank and product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% elsif compare != blank %}<span class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ compare | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div></div></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows"><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous plants">‹</button><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next plants">›</button></div></div></plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const tag='plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class PlantProducts extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.track=this.querySelector('[data-track]');this.prev=this.querySelector('[data-prev]');this.next=this.querySelector('[data-next]');this.prev.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));this.next.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1));this.track.addEventListener('scroll',()=>this.update(),{passive:true});this.observer=new ResizeObserver(()=>this.update());this.observer.observe(this.track);this.update()}disconnectedCallback(){if(this.observer)this.observer.disconnect()}move(d){const c=this.track.querySelector('article');if(c)this.track.scrollBy({left:d*(c.getBoundingClientRect().width+18),behavior:'smooth'})}update(){const max=this.track.scrollWidth-this.track.clientWidth;this.prev.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft<=2;this.next.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft>=max-2}}customElements.define(tag,PlantProducts)})();</script>
